@startuml UC03 - AI Lead Enrichment - Sequence Diagram
title UC03 - AI Lead Enrichment - Sequence Diagram

actor "Sales User" as Sales
participant "Next.js" as FE
participant "NestJS API" as API
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "n8n" as N8N
participant "External API" as EXT
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Sales -> FE : 1. Request Lead Enrichment
FE -> API : 2. POST /leads/:id/enrich
API -> DB : 3. Validate Lead
DB --> API : 4. Lead data
API -> MQ : 5. Publish enrichment event
MQ -> N8N : 6. Deliver message
N8N -> API : 7. Get Lead information
API --> N8N : 8. Return Lead data
N8N -> EXT : 9. Request external enrichment
EXT --> N8N : 10. Return company/contact data
N8N -> API : 11. POST enrichment result
API -> DB : 12. Save enrichment result

@enduml
